WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.043
In tutorial 4.7, you'll see how your
website describes your business,

00:00:11.093 --> 00:00:13.335
and which searches could
bring you customers.

00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:19.826
First, open Run an analysis. Under Research,
click Start on Describe my website.

00:00:21.329 --> 00:00:25.879
Then choose the website to describe.
It works on your own verified website,

00:00:25.929 --> 00:00:28.781
and Past runs keeps every
description you've made.

00:00:29.776 --> 00:00:32.896
Here's what you'll get: a
short summary of your business,

00:00:32.946 --> 00:00:36.943
your products and services, who
they're for, and what sets you apart.

00:00:37.897 --> 00:00:42.447
You also get a suggested page title
and description for search results,

00:00:42.497 --> 00:00:45.861
and 8 to 10 searches customers
would use to find you.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:50.730
The Summary shows the price in
credits and about how long it takes.

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.475
When you're ready, click
Describe my website.

00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:59.109
Your run page shows its progress. In a
couple of minutes, your report is ready.

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:01.700
Open it here, or later from Reports.

00:01:02.699 --> 00:01:07.499
Your report shows your business in one line,
with a count of your offers, audiences,

00:01:07.549 --> 00:01:09.272
selling points and searches.

00:01:10.245 --> 00:01:14.995
Below, read the full description, every
product and service your website names,

00:01:15.045 --> 00:01:16.822
and the customers it speaks to.

00:01:17.796 --> 00:01:22.086
Then see what sets you apart, and
your positioning: the area you serve,

00:01:22.136 --> 00:01:25.459
your brand's tone, and a
suggested title and description.

00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:30.773
Finally, under Keywords customers would
search, click a search to check it.

00:01:32.421 --> 00:01:35.246
Keyword verdict opens with
that search filled in,

00:01:35.296 --> 00:01:37.633
ready to tell you whether
it's worth a page.

00:01:38.967 --> 00:01:43.152
Now you have a plain description of your
business, and searches worth checking.

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:47.062
You can download it, save
it as a PDF, or share it.

00:01:47.112 --> 00:01:49.479
Tutorial 4.6 shows how.

00:01:50.474 --> 00:01:55.199
Tip: the report lists the pages it
read. If something you sell is missing,

00:01:55.249 --> 00:01:59.142
say it clearly on those pages,
then describe your website again.

00:02:00.151 --> 00:02:04.956
So, open Describe my website, see what
you'll get, start it, read your summary,

00:02:05.006 --> 00:02:06.663
and check a suggested search.

00:02:07.681 --> 00:02:10.256
Now you know how your
website comes across.

00:02:10.306 --> 00:02:13.871
Next, read your Pipeline, in tutorial 5.1.
